231a1dbf42"},{"name":"via","value":"CHN-SH-CT13-CACHE35[119],CHN-SH-CT13-CACHE35[ovl,117]"}],"cookies":[],"content":{"size":3241,"mimeType":"application/json","compression":1435,"text":"{\"success\":true,\"code\":0,\"result\":{\"uuid\":\"d54b0d8e884945fb8d875979510b5211\",\"path\":\"carele/ji-yu-MT2492de-mi-ni-Buckxiang-ya-mu-kuai\",\"name\":\"基于MT2492的迷你Buck降压模块\",\"content\":\"掰断引脚可以贴片形式安装。\\n![1685893980235.jpg](//image.lceda.cn/pullimage/yb7iWPbfG1zZuh2YKk40GplMturVgCl0lMuaL69C.jpeg)\\n\\n![1685893980250.jpg](//image.lceda.cn/pullimage/0R3N0WMMkGlzgM2o6WYZPAcOZlhLduZCgzYYQybP.jpeg)\\n\\n![1685893980259.jpg](//image.lceda.cn/pullimage/vvkzG895O28gQVhtF1jxDpuyFQr0jQVSyTjrkvON.jpeg)\\n可以通过可调电阻R4进行电压调整。（R3和R4二选一焊接）\\n电压与可调电阻R4大小的关系如下：\\n![输出电压与可调电阻的关系.jpg](//image.lceda.cn/pullimage/VTa8APGOY95ezxOPscvjwLvlkApKS6czp8FiO7Qx.jpeg)\\n\\n分别测试1.8V，3.3V与5V的电压输出（12V输入），结果如下：\\n![1685893980288.jpg](//image.lceda.cn/pullimage/Mw2d7e7JwSmGPxhFVnudFyvOlp1NafCxJh92NPRm.jpeg)\\n\\n![1685893980278.jpg](//image.lceda.cn/pullimage/3Pddc6j4ljMqxADBWXRpgEf7fmoBbGulZkdp53Wy.jpeg)\\n\\n![1685893980268.jpg](//image.lceda.cn/pullimage/k40Gjx6Nq9f5r0beMzB1CzLuO1B3xfDPoxSOnjzA.jpeg)\\n（调整可调电阻得到电压结果有略微误差）\",\"introduction\":\"基于MT2492的迷你Buck降压模块，可以直插或贴片方式安装在PCB中。\",\"grade\":1,\"public\":true,\"license\":\"GPL 3.0\",\"text_editor_type\":\"markdown\",\"creator\":{\"uuid\":\"bd44fc34722f4b89a8a7fda0fb77ca7b\",\"username\":\"carele\",\"nickname\":\"Carele\",\"avatar\":\"//image.lceda.cn/avatars/2024/7/ugQSCJo2x80pyZIIgzXIizMsNWlmvKa19drQSUuS.png\"},\"owner\":{\"uuid\":\"bd44fc34722f4b89a8a7fda0fb77ca7b\",\"username\":\"carele\",\"nickname\":\"Carele\",\"avatar\":\"//image.lceda.cn/avatars/2024/7/ugQSCJo2x80pyZIIgzXIizMsNWlmvKa19drQSUuS.png\",\"team\":false},\"origin\":\"pro\",\"is_draft\":false,\"publish\":true,\"members\":[{\"uuid\":\"bd44fc34722f4b89a8a7fda0fb77ca7b\",\"username\":\"carele\",\"nickname\":\"Carele\",\"avatar\":\"//image.lceda.cn/avatars/2024/7/ugQSCJo2x80pyZIIgzXIizMsNWlmvKa1